1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,040
June had spent all morning waiting for a call.

2
00:00:03,040 --> 00:00:03,970
It never came.

3
00:00:04,625 --> 00:00:05,811
Milo couldn’t fix that.

4
00:00:05,811 --> 00:00:07,294
But he picked up the

5
00:00:07,294 --> 00:00:08,777
little flower on the table.

6
00:00:09,458 --> 00:00:11,945
He held it out. June took it,

7
00:00:11,945 --> 00:00:13,010
and finally smiled.

8
00:00:13,667 --> 00:00:16,691
The call still hadn’t come. At least now,

9
00:00:16,691 --> 00:00:18,203
she wasn’t waiting alone.
